---
description: Corrected agent mistakes become rules, same session
alwaysApply: true
---
When the user corrects a repeatable, repo-specific mistake you made (wrong
command, wrong path, wrong assumption about the stack), do both in this session:
1. Fix the work.
2. Add or tighten a rule in .cursor/rules/ (and mirror the fact into CLAUDE.md
   or AGENTS.md if it is a fact, not a behavior). Prefer small, concrete rules
   over broad policy text. One mistake, one rule.
